Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.17,0:01:04.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,终于完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:04.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's finally complete
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.24,0:01:06.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,连续好几周
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.24,0:01:06.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,After weeks and weeks
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.83,0:01:08.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,耗费心血  蜡烛两头烧之后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.83,0:01:08.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of burning the candle at both ends
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.29,0:01:10.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的在烧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.29,0:01:10.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,literally
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.65,0:01:14.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的第一份竖笛协奏曲完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.65,0:01:14.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My first clarinet concerto is complete
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.85,0:01:17.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以拿来演奏了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.85,0:01:17.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and ready to be performed
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.64,0:01:24.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.64,0:01:24.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Noooooo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.43,0:01:28.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这下蜡炬成灰了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.43,0:01:28.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, I'm flummoxed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.49,0:01:41.08,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(588,612)}出租
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.50,0:01:37.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再敲一下  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.50,0:01:37.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hit it one more time, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.12,0:01:38.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可不能被谁给偷走了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.12,0:01:38.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't want anyone stealing it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.99,0:01:42.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,行了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.99,0:01:42.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.99,0:01:46.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,外面到底是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.99,0:01:46.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, what's going on out here?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.40,0:01:48.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吵得我都没法集中注意力了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.40,0:01:48.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't even hear myself think
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.40,0:01:48.37,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(886.231,920)}听见自己思考
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.47,0:01:51.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你能闻到自己思考吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.47,0:01:51.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can you smell yourself think?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.77,0:01:53.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.77,0:01:53.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.18,0:01:56.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我刚说过  你们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.18,0:01:56.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,As I was saying, you two--
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.26,0:01:57.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能看到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.26,0:01:57.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Or see?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.59,0:01:58.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.59,0:01:58.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.77,0:01:59.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.77,0:01:59.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How--
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.13,0:02:00.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能尝得到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.13,0:02:00.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,how about taste?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.27,0:02:01.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能尝得到自己思考吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.27,0:02:01.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can you taste yourself think?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.72,0:02:02.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.72,0:02:02.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Shut it
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.57,0:02:04.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个白痴在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.57,0:02:04.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you two dingbats doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.45,0:02:07.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们这是在立派大星新做的出租标牌
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.45,0:02:07.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We were just posting Patrick's new "for rent" sign
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.05,0:02:08.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,忙了一早上呢  看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.05,0:02:08.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We worked on it all morning, see?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.90,0:02:09.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,出租
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.90,0:02:09.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"For rent"?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.11,0:02:10.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.11,0:02:10.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You mean
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.10,0:02:13.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们其中一个要搬走了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.10,0:02:13.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One of you is moving out?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.96,0:02:14.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.96,0:02:14.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.92,0:02:17.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星是要出租他家前院
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.92,0:02:17.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick here is just gonna rent out his front yard
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.20,0:02:20.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,赚点外快  懂我意思吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.20,0:02:20.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Need a little extra cash, if you know what I mean
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.83,0:02:25.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想到今天一开始就诸事不顺  现在又
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.83,0:02:25.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,To think this day started off so horribly and now
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.55,0:02:27.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们出租自家前院是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.55,0:02:26.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you mean you're just gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.66,0:02:27.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,rent out your front yard?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.92,0:02:30.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先到先得
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.92,0:02:30.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,First come, first served
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.08,0:02:31.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.08,0:02:31.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Great
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.65,0:02:33.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这下又有个白痴能搬进来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.65,0:02:33.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now another idiot can move in
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.19,0:02:35.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  倒提醒我了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.19,0:02:35.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, that reminds me
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.25,0:02:37.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跟派大星今天整天都要去水母田
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.25,0:02:37.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick and I are off to jellyfish fields for the day
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.81,0:02:39.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道你能不能留在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.81,0:02:39.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We were wondering if maybe you could stick around
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.84,0:02:41.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,留意一下有没有人来租
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.84,0:02:41.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and keep an eye out for any takers
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.15,0:02:43.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我可太想了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.15,0:02:43.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I would love to
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.57,0:02:45.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先查查我的日程表
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.57,0:02:45.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just let me just check my planner
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.12,0:02:46.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.12,0:02:46.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.92,0:02:48.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行  抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.92,0:02:48.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, I'm sorry
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.94,0:02:49.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,并不能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.94,0:02:49.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.26,0:02:50.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.26,0:02:50.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.89,0:02:55.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为我今天计划好不干这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.89,0:02:55.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, because I was planning to do no such thing
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:02:57.11,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(340,794)}今天\N不干这种事
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.11,0:02:56.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看见没
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:02:56.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.11,0:02:58.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧  还是谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.11,0:02:58.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, well, thanks anyway
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.93,0:03:00.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.93,0:03:00.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.75,0:03:03.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,既然那俩白痴一整天不在
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.75,0:03:03.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, with those two bone-brains gone for the day
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.95,0:03:06.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我至少总算可以享受点安宁和
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.95,0:03:06.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,at least now I can finally get some peace and
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.23,0:03:10.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,清静
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.23,0:03:10.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Quiet
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.76,0:03:13.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们俩白痴又怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.76,0:03:13.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now what are you two boobs up to?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.68,0:03:14.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们不是要去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.68,0:03:14.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I thought you were gonna--
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.22,0:03:19.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,如果他们不在  那到底
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.22,0:03:19.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, if they're not here, then I wonder
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.79,0:03:20.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是谁在吵来吵去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.79,0:03:20.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,who could have been making all of that--
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.97,0:03:21.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.97,0:03:21.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.22,0:03:23.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我叫霍华德
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.22,0:03:23.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My name is Howard
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.65,0:03:24.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好  霍华德
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.65,0:03:24.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello, Howard
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.87,0:03:26.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我注意到了这个出租标牌
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.87,0:03:26.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I noticed this "for rent" sign
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.93,0:03:28.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,前院还能租吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.93,0:03:28.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is this yard still for rent?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.91,0:03:29.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.91,0:03:29.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.52,0:03:30.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你来晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.52,0:03:30.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're too late
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.43,0:03:33.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,霍华德好失望
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.43,0:03:33.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Howard is disappointed
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.42,0:03:35.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  谁不是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.42,0:03:35.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, aren't we all?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.06,0:03:40.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这里本来也许还适合任我追寻爱好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.06,0:03:37.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This looked like it might have been
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.55,0:03:40.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a wonderful place to pursue my passions
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.55,0:03:42.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,爱好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.55,0:03:42.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Passions"?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.15,0:03:43.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,绘画
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.15,0:03:43.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Painting
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.07,0:03:43.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,绘画吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.07,0:03:43.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Painting?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.54,0:03:44.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吹低音管
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.54,0:03:44.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Playing the bassoon
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.82,0:03:45.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,低音管
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.82,0:03:45.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The bassoon?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.62,0:03:48.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在我前院品一杯茶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.62,0:03:48.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And enjoying a glass of tea in my front yard
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.83,0:03:50.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,品一杯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.83,0:03:50.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Enjoying a glass of
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.85,0:03:56.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不敢相信我的耳朵
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.85,0:03:56.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can hardly believe what I'm hearing
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.18,0:04:00.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,总算来了个有文化的邻居
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.18,0:04:00.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Finally, a neighbor with some culture
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.04,0:04:02.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我已经能想象到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.04,0:04:02.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can only imagine
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.10,0:04:06.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一边肖像  一边品茶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.10,0:04:06.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Painting portraits while sipping tea
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.90,0:04:11.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,骑斜躺自行车去博物馆
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.90,0:04:11.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Recumbent bicycling to a museum
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.10,0:04:15.02,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(658,140)}博物馆
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.22,0:04:19.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在裤头村爱乐乐团一起演奏协奏曲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.22,0:04:16.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Playing a concerto together
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.69,0:04:19.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,at the bikini bottom philharmonic
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.57,0:04:26.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再会
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.57,0:04:26.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Farewell
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.47,0:04:27.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,早该知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.47,0:04:27.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I should have known
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.52,0:04:29.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这种事情简直棒得跟假的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.52,0:04:29.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,all this was too good to be true
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.79,0:04:36.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.79,0:04:36.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.72,0:04:37.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别走
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.72,0:04:37.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't go
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.20,0:04:40.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我  我刚刚开玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.20,0:04:40.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I-I was just kidding
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.02,0:04:43.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧  那样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.02,0:04:43.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, well, in that case
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.55,0:04:45.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那我就马上搬进来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.55,0:04:45.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll move in right away
Dialogue: 1,0:04:45.61,0:04:46.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.61,0:04:46.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wonderful
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.94,0:04:49.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别客气  把这当自己家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.94,0:04:49.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Make yourself at home
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.62,0:04:50.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.62,0:04:50.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, my
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.64,0:04:53.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他的设计品味无可挑剔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.64,0:04:53.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,His design sense is impeccable
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.31,0:04:54.64,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(964,734)}霍华德
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.45,0:04:57.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感觉像在自己家一样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.45,0:04:57.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I do feel right at home
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.70,0:04:59.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.70,0:04:59.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okeydoke, then
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.35,0:05:03.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我想为我的新邻居干杯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.35,0:05:03.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd like to propose a toast to my new neighbor
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.36,0:05:05.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,新邻居
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.36,0:05:05.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,New neighbor
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.49,0:05:08.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,既然说到这了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.49,0:05:08.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,While we're on the topic
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.47,0:05:11.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,附近的邻居都是些什么样的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.47,0:05:11.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are the other neighbors like who live around here?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.97,0:05:13.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,邻居嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.97,0:05:13.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Other neighbors?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.47,0:05:16.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就跟一般的邻居没什么两样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.47,0:05:16.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They're just like any other neighbors, I suppose
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.87,0:05:18.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.87,0:05:18.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, that's perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.40,0:05:21.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跟邻居基本上都处得来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.40,0:05:21.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm the type of person who likes all kinds of neighbors
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.63,0:05:23.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,确实挺好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.63,0:05:23.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That is perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.35,0:05:26.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要他们不捉水母
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.35,0:05:26.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, as long as they're not jellyfishers
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.44,0:05:30.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我受不了跟捉水母的当邻居
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.44,0:05:30.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't stand living near anybody who jellyfishes
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.89,0:05:34.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过幸好  他们不算最烂的那种邻居
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.89,0:05:34.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But, luckily, they're not the worst type of neighbor
Dialogue: 1,0:05:34.20,0:05:35.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  还
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.20,0:05:35.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, that--
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.31,0:05:36.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,确实幸好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.31,0:05:36.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that is lucky
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.47,0:05:40.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最烂的就是吹泡泡的邻居
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.47,0:05:40.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That would be the bubble-blowers
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.98,0:05:43.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,夹在捉水母的跟吹泡泡的中间
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.98,0:05:43.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Between the jellyfishers and bubble-blowers
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.92,0:05:47.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从前的社区根本没法住  只能搬走
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.92,0:05:45.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I just couldn't stand to stay
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.69,0:05:47.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,in my old neighborhood anymore
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.82,0:05:49.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放心吧  霍华德
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.82,0:05:49.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, rest assured, Howard
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.82,0:05:54.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你绝对注意不到这附近的邻居
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.82,0:05:52.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Y-You'll never even notice
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.74,0:05:54.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the neighbors around here
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.10,0:05:56.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就放心了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.10,0:05:56.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, that's a relief
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.57,0:05:57.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.57,0:05:57.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, isn't it?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.17,0:06:15.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  快看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.17,0:06:15.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, look
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.47,0:06:18.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我家门口停着一辆房车
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.47,0:06:16.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's a mobile home
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.77,0:06:18.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,parked in front of my house
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.27,0:06:20.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  知道是什么意思吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.27,0:06:20.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, do you know what that means?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.42,0:06:23.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是房东了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.42,0:06:23.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm a landlord
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.92,0:06:26.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,房东万岁
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.92,0:06:26.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All hail the landlord
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.49,0:06:29.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.49,0:06:29.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:06:29.80,0:06:30.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.80,0:06:30.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.40,0:06:32.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不然我们过去敲下门
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.40,0:06:32.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why don't we go knock on the door
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.80,0:06:34.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,认识一下新邻居吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.80,0:06:34.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and meet the new neighbor?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.57,0:06:35.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.57,0:06:35.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Great idea
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.45,0:06:36.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,完了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.45,0:06:36.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.67,0:06:37.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.67,0:06:37.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.97,0:06:39.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是有谁来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.97,0:06:39.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is somebody there?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:39.04,0:06:39.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.04,0:06:39.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:06:39.65,0:06:40.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.65,0:06:40.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.03,0:06:42.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,方圆几里都没有别的谁在
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.03,0:06:42.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's nobody at all for miles around
Dialogue: 1,0:06:42.38,0:06:43.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你确定吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.38,0:06:43.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, are you sure?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.67,0:06:45.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我好像都听到讲话声了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.67,0:06:45.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I thought I heard voices
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.50,0:06:46.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没  没有讲话声
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.50,0:06:46.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nope, there weren't any voices
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.15,0:06:49.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可能就只是其他邻居要过来认识我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.15,0:06:49.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it's just the other neighbors coming to meet me
Dialogue: 1,0:06:49.95,0:06:51.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最好开门看一看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.95,0:06:51.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We'd better open it up and have a look
Dialogue: 1,0:06:51.76,0:06:52.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不能让你开
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.76,0:06:52.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't let you do that
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.87,0:06:54.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然能开了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.87,0:06:54.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, of course you can
Dialogue: 1,0:06:54.75,0:06:56.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他们也是你邻居嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.75,0:06:56.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They're your neighbors too
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.25,0:06:56.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.25,0:06:56.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.77,0:06:58.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你可千万不能出去  相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.77,0:06:58.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You really don't want to go out there, trust me
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.78,0:07:00.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你弄疼我胳膊了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.78,0:07:00.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're hurting my arm
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.84,0:07:01.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  霍华德
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.84,0:07:01.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Howard
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.85,0:07:05.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我只是希望咱俩能
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.85,0:07:05.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was just hoping you and I could, um
Dialogue: 1,0:07:05.20,0:07:06.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.20,0:07:06.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Could what?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.45,0:07:07.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.45,0:07:07.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Could, uh
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.53,0:07:09.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,趁着现在这么清净安宁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.53,0:07:09.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,take advantage of this peace and quiet
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.51,0:07:09.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.51,0:07:09.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and--
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.93,0:07:13.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一起合奏一曲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.93,0:07:13.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and perform a little duet together
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.03,0:07:15.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就咱俩  一起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.03,0:07:15.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,just the two of us, with each other
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.95,0:07:17.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是说  你吹低音管
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.95,0:07:17.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know, you on bassoon
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.38,0:07:18.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我吹竖笛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.38,0:07:18.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,me on clarinet--
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.50,0:07:19.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一起来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.50,0:07:19.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,together
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.22,0:07:21.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是个好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.22,0:07:21.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, that's a splendid idea
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.70,0:07:23.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我去找乐谱来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.70,0:07:23.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll get some sheet music
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.46,0:07:24.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.46,0:07:24.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wonderful
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.70,0:07:32.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你刚看到窗帘猛地拉上的样子没
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.70,0:07:32.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did you see the way those curtains jerked shut?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.94,0:07:35.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看到了  我们的新邻居一定很害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.94,0:07:35.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, our new neighbor must be really shy
Dialogue: 1,0:07:35.97,0:07:38.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那我们就等会儿再来认识他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.97,0:07:38.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe we should just come back and meet him later
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.96,0:07:42.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是好险啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.96,0:07:42.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was close
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.27,0:07:43.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.27,0:07:43.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good idea, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:07:43.14,0:07:44.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等会再来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.14,0:07:44.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,coming back later
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.15,0:07:45.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.15,0:07:45.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.00,0:07:48.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,并且咱还有更要紧的事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.00,0:07:48.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Besides, we have more pressing matters to attend to
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.15,0:07:48.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,比如说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.15,0:07:48.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Like what?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:49.15,0:07:51.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,比如说我们新交上的水母朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.15,0:07:51.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Like this new jellyfish we befriended
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.47,0:07:54.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有这瓶全新的泡泡水
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.47,0:07:54.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and this brand-new bottle of bubbles
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.92,0:07:59.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.92,0:07:59.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's begin
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.25,0:08:04.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  这绝对就是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.25,0:08:04.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squiddy, this is absolutely
Dialogue: 1,0:08:04.44,0:08:06.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你一生中最美好的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.44,0:08:06.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the best day of your life
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.97,0:08:13.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这就怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.97,0:08:13.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Perplexing
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.56,0:08:16.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我先前肯定调过音了的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.56,0:08:16.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I could have sworn I just had this thing tuned
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.51,0:08:17.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怪我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.51,0:08:17.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's me
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.47,0:08:17.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怪我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.47,0:08:17.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's me
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.83,0:08:20.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我  我看这簧片得换了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.83,0:08:20.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I-I think this reed needs replacing
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.48,0:08:21.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.48,0:08:21.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.14,0:08:21.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,马上就回来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.14,0:08:21.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.44,0:08:34.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,应该是好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.44,0:08:34.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Should be all better now
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.80,0:08:36.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要继续吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.80,0:08:36.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Shall we continue?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.30,0:08:37.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.30,0:08:37.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, of course
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.22,0:08:40.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  你看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.22,0:08:40.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, SpongeBob, look
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.55,0:08:43.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,新邻居一定比我们想的还要害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.55,0:08:43.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Our new neighbor must be even shier than we thought
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.75,0:08:44.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.75,0:08:44.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:08:48.87,0:08:50.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.87,0:08:50.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There it is again
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.02,0:08:54.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再失陪一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.02,0:08:54.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me one more time
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.84,0:09:08.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.84,0:09:08.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just a sec
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.67,0:09:17.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,刚吹到哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.67,0:09:17.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, where were we?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.95,0:09:41.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.95,0:09:41.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm back
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.17,0:09:42.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.17,0:09:42.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What is going on?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.76,0:09:44.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是想隐瞒什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.76,0:09:44.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you hiding something?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.82,0:09:45.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,霍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.82,0:09:45.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ho--
Dialogue: 1,0:09:45.37,0:09:48.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,霍华德  我我没想隐瞒你什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.37,0:09:48.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Howard, I-I would never hide anything from you
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.85,0:09:50.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,站一边去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.85,0:09:50.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stand aside
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.02,0:10:00.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.02,0:10:00.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Repulsive
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.83,0:10:04.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得让那俩既吹泡泡又捉水母的别闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.83,0:10:02.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Somebody's got to stop
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.12,0:10:04.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,these pesky bubble-blowing jellyfishers
Dialogue: 1,0:10:04.87,0:10:05.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.87,0:10:05.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.45,0:10:07.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,求你了  霍华德
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.45,0:10:07.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Please, Howard
Dialogue: 1,0:10:07.63,0:10:08.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别走
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.63,0:10:08.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,don't go
Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.65,0:10:12.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是我在这多年来唯一的一缕阳光啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.65,0:10:12.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're the only ray of sunshine I've had here in years
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.35,0:10:13.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.35,0:10:13.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.37,0:10:16.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,已经来不及了  章鱼哥先生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.37,0:10:16.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's too late, Mr. Tentacles
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.14,0:10:19.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海神王啊  不要
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.14,0:10:19.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Dear Neptune, no
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.72,0:10:21.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.72,0:10:21.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You there
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.82,0:10:27.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还算有点好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.82,0:10:27.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That actually was kind of fun
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.40,0:10:31.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许我该不要再那么古板了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.40,0:10:31.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's time I stopped being so stuffy
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.71,0:10:33.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,稍微放松一下  换换口味
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.71,0:10:33.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and loosened up for a change
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.02,0:10:35.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.02,0:10:35.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.50,0:10:36.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,碰到了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.50,0:10:36.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gotcha
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.16,0:10:55.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也许能应付得了两个白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.16,0:10:55.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I may be able to handle two lamebrain boneheads
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.94,0:10:57.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但绝对不能接受三个白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.94,0:10:57.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but I draw the line at three
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.28,0:11:05.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的家
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.28,0:11:05.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My house
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.12,0:11:16.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就知道棒得跟假的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.12,0:11:16.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I knew it was too good to be true
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.60,0:11:20.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,差点就有个像样的邻居了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.60,0:11:20.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I almost had a decent neighbor
Dialogue: 1,0:11:20.78,0:11:22.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,放心  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.78,0:11:22.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.47,0:11:24.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们能让你开心点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.47,0:11:24.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We can cheer you up
Dialogue: 1,0:11:26.83,0:11:27.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.83,0:11:27.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go on
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.16,0:11:29.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,扎破它
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.16,0:11:29.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pop it
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.19,0:11:29.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,扎破它吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.19,0:11:29.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pop it?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.87,0:11:30.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.87,0:11:30.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.04,0:11:34.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都到这地步了  还能有什么损失
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.04,0:11:34.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, at this point, what have I got to lose?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:41.47,0:11:42.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你给我回来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.47,0:11:42.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You come back here
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.81,0:11:52.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,既捉水母又吹泡泡的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.81,0:11:52.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Jellyfishing bubble-blowers
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.06,0:11:56.57,起司 特殊标题,,0,0,0,,章鱼之爱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.82,0:12:01.49,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1096,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.82,0:11:59.07,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(237.33,454)}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.82,0:11:59.07,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(507.661,760)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.19,0:12:01.45,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(411.575,444)}创意总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.19,0:12:01.45,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(531.742,698)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.61,0:12:04.03,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(431.6,534)}制片指导
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.61,0:12:04.03,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1034.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.11,0:12:05.62,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(394,438)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.02,0:12:07.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.02,0:12:07.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me
Dialogue: 1,0:12:07.07,0:12:08.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请给女士来份蟹黄堡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.07,0:12:08.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A patty for the lady, please
Dialogue: 1,0:12:09.13,0:12:11.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看牌子  风流浪子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.13,0:12:11.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Try reading the sign, Casanova
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.62,0:12:12.12,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(632,844)}我在休息  请勿打扰
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.50,0:12:16.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你这是不识字吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.50,0:12:16.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You never learned to read, did you?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.40,0:12:17.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.40,0:12:17.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.05,0:12:18.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.05,0:12:18.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's all right
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.17,0:12:19.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也不识字
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.17,0:12:19.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Neither did I
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.27,0:12:21.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们简直是天生一对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.27,0:12:21.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We are meant for each other
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.75,0:12:25.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,连文盲都能找到真爱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.75,0:12:25.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Even the illiterate are finding love
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.64,0:12:27.30,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(492,754)}章鱼\N之爱
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.17,0:12:27.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.17,0:12:27.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.50,0:12:30.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,为什么非得用言情故事折磨自己
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.50,0:12:30.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,why are you torturing yourself with tales of romance?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:34.48,0:12:35.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.48,0:12:35.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.53,0:12:36.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的呜掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.53,0:12:36.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You dropped your "ook"
Dialogue: 1,0:12:36.65,0:12:37.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那不是呜
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.65,0:12:37.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's no "ook"
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.90,0:12:39.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只是一个残酷的提醒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.90,0:12:39.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's just a cruel reminder
Dialogue: 1,0:12:39.29,0:12:42.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,提醒我还是单身  以后多半孤独终老
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.29,0:12:42.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that I'm single and likely to remain that way forever
Dialogue: 1,0:12:42.15,0:12:43.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别难过  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.15,0:12:43.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't be sad, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:12:43.87,0:12:45.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,把你的皱眉倒过来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.87,0:12:45.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Turn that frown upside down
Dialogue: 1,0:12:46.24,0:12:50.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我宁愿让我的皱眉保持在传统的方向
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.24,0:12:50.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I prefer my frowns in their traditional orientation
Dialogue: 1,0:12:52.04,0:12:53.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别忘了  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.04,0:12:53.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just remember, Squidward--
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.46,0:12:55.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你还没体验过真爱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.46,0:12:55.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you have never experienced true love
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.77,0:12:57.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.77,0:12:57.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.82,0:12:59.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不代表你永远找不到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.82,0:12:59.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That doesn't mean you will never find it
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.95,0:13:00.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,俗话说得好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.95,0:13:00.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know the saying--
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.97,0:13:02.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一只章鱼一个坑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.97,0:13:02.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's a squid for every pot
Dialogue: 1,0:13:02.51,0:13:03.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.51,0:13:03.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Great
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.25,0:13:06.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就让陈腔滥调流传下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.25,0:13:06.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let the tired cliches cascade forward
Dialogue: 1,0:13:06.20,0:13:07.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能让我好受点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.20,0:13:07.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That'll make me feel better
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.98,0:13:10.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.98,0:13:10.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wha--
Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.58,0:13:11.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.58,0:13:11.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who--
Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.94,0:13:14.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.94,0:13:14.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,who is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.52,0:13:15.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.52,0:13:15.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She's
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.05,0:13:16.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.05,0:13:16.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She's
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.17,0:13:25.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我太爱这装修了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.17,0:13:25.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I absolutely adore the decor--
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.40,0:13:27.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,极致简约
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.40,0:13:27.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,exquisitely minimalist
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.17,0:13:29.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她会艺术行话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.17,0:13:29.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She speaks art jargon
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.66,0:13:33.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,菜单上可有什么美味佳肴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.66,0:13:33.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What culinary delights doth this menu hold?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:34.22,0:13:36.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  她样样都有
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.22,0:13:36.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, she's got it all--
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.17,0:13:36.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,格调
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.17,0:13:36.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,class
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.82,0:13:37.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,风度
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.82,0:13:37.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,style
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.44,0:13:38.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,优雅
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.44,0:13:38.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,grace
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.05,0:13:40.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且看来只跟我配
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.05,0:13:40.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and looks only matched by yours truly
Dialogue: 1,0:13:41.82,0:13:43.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那你就约她出去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.82,0:13:43.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, why don't you ask her out
Dialogue: 1,0:13:43.13,0:13:45.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来场你一直说的那个约会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.13,0:13:45.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,on one of those dates you keep talking about?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.52,0:13:47.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,正有此意
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.52,0:13:47.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My next move exactly
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.15,0:13:52.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,尽情领略我这章鱼的魅力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.15,0:13:52.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Observe the old tentacles charm in all its glory
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.44,0:13:59.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在说三文鱼语吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.44,0:13:59.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is that Salmonese?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.77,0:14:05.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你刚刚一副不知所措的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.77,0:14:05.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Boy, you were floundering up there
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.52,0:14:07.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不知道我在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.52,0:14:07.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I'm doing
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.20,0:14:08.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,以前从来就没这种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.20,0:14:08.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've never felt like this before
Dialogue: 1,0:14:09.51,0:14:12.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  你被爱之虫咬到了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.51,0:14:12.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squiddy, you have been bitten by the love bug
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.57,0:14:13.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.57,0:14:13.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.41,0:14:14.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.41,0:14:14.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.31,0:14:15.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我想要点餐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.31,0:14:15.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd like to order
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.67,0:14:16.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她在跟我说话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.67,0:14:16.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She's talking to me
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.63,0:14:17.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.63,0:14:17.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.42,0:14:20.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  我能帮你吸引到真爱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.42,0:14:20.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, I can help you attract your true love
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.03,0:14:20.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就凭你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.03,0:14:20.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.62,0:14:23.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你对浪漫主义艺术可谓一窍不通
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.62,0:14:21.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You don't know the first thing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.46,0:14:23.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,about the fine art of romance
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.04,0:14:26.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,既然没人接单
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.04,0:14:26.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, since no one seems to want to take my order
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.33,0:14:27.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就去别家了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.33,0:14:27.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll go elsewhere
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.20,0:14:28.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.20,0:14:28.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.92,0:14:29.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.92,0:14:29.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She's leaving
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.47,0:14:30.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这可不见得
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.47,0:14:30.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, she's not
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.40,0:14:32.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,撑住  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.40,0:14:32.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hang on, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.20,0:14:38.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这里总算能给我提供服务了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.20,0:14:38.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Finally, some service around here
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.63,0:14:41.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,鱼哥章
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.63,0:14:41.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, idward-squay
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.17,0:14:43.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,了别忘会约
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.17,0:14:43.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Emember-ray the ate-day
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.25,0:14:47.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这位章鱼哥正准备邀请你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.25,0:14:47.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I believe Squidward here is trying to ask you
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.89,0:14:49.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来场浪漫约会  女士
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.89,0:14:49.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,on a romantic date, ma'am
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.70,0:14:50.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对吧  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.70,0:14:50.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right, Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.75,0:14:53.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快啊  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.75,0:14:53.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:14:53.87,0:14:55.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟这位女士握手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.87,0:14:55.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,shake the nice lady's hand
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.30,0:14:56.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,问个好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.30,0:14:56.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and say hello
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.37,0:14:57.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.37,0:14:57.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello
Dialogue: 1,0:14:57.83,0:15:00.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我叫章鱼妹
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.83,0:15:00.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My name is Squilvia
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.97,0:15:02.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.97,0:15:02.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is he okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:02.13,0:15:03.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.13,0:15:03.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes, he's--
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.17,0:15:04.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他只是累了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.17,0:15:04.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,he's just tired
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.73,0:15:07.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,毕竟他在这辛勤干活嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.73,0:15:05.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you know, from all the hard work
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.88,0:15:07.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,he's been doing around here
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.16,0:15:09.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我好崇拜他的职业操守
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.16,0:15:09.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I so admire his work ethic
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.20,0:15:13.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.20,0:15:13.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So what do you think?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.21,0:15:13.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要约他吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.21,0:15:13.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You want to date him?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.89,0:15:15.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.89,0:15:15.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.12,0:15:17.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不是很确定
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:17.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not too sure
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.67,0:15:18.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.67,0:15:18.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.63,0:15:20.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,趁你还没冲动做出决定
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.63,0:15:20.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Before you make any hasty decisions
Dialogue: 1,0:15:21.10,0:15:22.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我来跟你说说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.10,0:15:22.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Allow me to tell you
Dialogue: 1,0:15:22.40,0:15:24.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我朋友章鱼哥的二三事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.40,0:15:24.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a few things about my friend Squidward--
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.87,0:15:26.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是我觉得你应该知道的事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.87,0:15:26.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,things I think you should know
Dialogue: 1,0:15:26.32,0:15:30.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就比如章鱼哥是我所认识最聪明的人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.32,0:15:28.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,like that Squidward is by far
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.16,0:15:30.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the single most intelligent person I know
Dialogue: 1,0:15:30.61,0:15:31.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最聪明吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.61,0:15:31.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Intelligent?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.95,0:15:32.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.95,0:15:32.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.87,0:15:35.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说的正是文凭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.87,0:15:35.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We are talking some serious credentials
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.20,0:15:35.99,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\an3\pos(390,538)}逊大\N章鱼哥合格\N特颁此证
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.17,0:15:35.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,逊大
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.17,0:15:35.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Lame"?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.99,0:15:37.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那什么学校
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.99,0:15:37.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What school is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.33,0:15:38.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,重点在于  他觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.33,0:15:38.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The point is, he thinks
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.79,0:15:41.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你穿这身裙子就好像一缕纯粹的阳光
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.79,0:15:41.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you look like a breath of pure sunshine in that dress
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.46,0:15:42.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.46,0:15:42.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.71,0:15:44.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他真这么说吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.71,0:15:44.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He really said that?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:44.13,0:15:44.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.13,0:15:44.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You betcha
Dialogue: 1,0:15:44.96,0:15:45.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他就是个万人迷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.96,0:15:45.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He is such a charmer
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.47,0:15:48.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别忘了提艺术和音乐天赋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.47,0:15:48.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't forget artistic and musical
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.47,0:15:50.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,更别提他还是个不可思议的画家
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.47,0:15:50.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not to mention that he's an incredible painter
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.42,0:15:51.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,技艺超群的音乐家
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.42,0:15:51.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a virtuoso musician
Dialogue: 1,0:15:51.70,0:15:52.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,喜欢烹饪  爱干净
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.70,0:15:52.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,loves to cook and clean
Dialogue: 1,0:15:52.97,0:15:55.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且还热衷园艺
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.97,0:15:55.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and also enjoys gardening quite a bit too
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.53,0:15:57.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感觉他可有趣了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.53,0:15:57.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He sounds interesting
Dialogue: 1,0:15:57.93,0:16:01.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但你知道章鱼哥哪里最神吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.93,0:15:59.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But you know what is the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.02,0:16:01.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,most amazing thing about Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.48,0:16:04.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就是他分外无私
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.48,0:16:04.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's his selflessness
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.30,0:16:08.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还坚定不移地致力于成为真正的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.30,0:16:08.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,his undying commitment to being a true friend
Dialogue: 1,0:16:08.70,0:16:11.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且只要有谁运气够好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.70,0:16:11.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And I know anyone who is lucky enough
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.12,0:16:13.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能跟他来一场浪漫约会
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.12,0:16:13.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to go on a "romantical" date with this guy
Dialogue: 1,0:16:14.67,0:16:18.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个谁的体验就可以更上一层楼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.67,0:16:16.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,would get to experience things
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.16,0:16:18.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,on a whole nother and very special level
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.97,0:16:21.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,八点钟共进晚餐行吗  章鱼妹
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.97,0:16:21.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So how does dinner at 8:00 sound, squilvia?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.66,0:16:23.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感觉很完美
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.66,0:16:23.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think that sounds perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.60,0:16:25.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,到时候来你家  好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.60,0:16:25.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll come by your place, okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:26.88,0:16:29.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,八点见  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.88,0:16:29.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See you at 8:00, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.08,0:16:34.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事吧  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.08,0:16:34.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You okay, Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.13,0:16:35.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你冻住了  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.13,0:16:35.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You froze up there, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.55,0:16:35.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,啥意思
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.55,0:16:35.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.97,0:16:36.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我意思是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.97,0:16:36.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I mean
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.80,0:16:38.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你上次约会是什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.80,0:16:38.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,When was the last time you went out on a date?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.69,0:16:47.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  一定要帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.69,0:16:47.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, you got to help me
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.31,0:16:49.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太久没约会了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.31,0:16:49.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's been so long
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.11,0:16:49.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.11,0:16:49.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.77,0:16:50.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.77,0:16:50.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.32,0:16:52.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你  我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.32,0:16:52.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You, my friend
Dialogue: 1,0:16:52.19,0:16:54.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,迫切需要先进行约会演习
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.19,0:16:54.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,are in desperate need of a practice date
Dialogue: 1,0:16:54.11,0:16:55.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后才去真正的约会
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.11,0:16:55.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,before going on the real thing
Dialogue: 1,0:16:55.24,0:16:57.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是个好办法  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.24,0:16:57.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's a great idea, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.40,0:16:58.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就只要先
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.40,0:16:58.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll just have
Dialogue: 1,0:16:59.07,0:17:00.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,约会演习
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.07,0:17:00.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A practice date?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:00.25,0:17:00.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没听懂
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.25,0:17:00.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't get it
Dialogue: 1,0:17:00.97,0:17:02.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,五点钟到我家碰面
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.97,0:17:02.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just meet me at 5:00 at my place
Dialogue: 1,0:17:02.34,0:17:03.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,行吗  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.34,0:17:03.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,okay, Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.46,0:17:08.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再等一下  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.46,0:17:08.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just one minute, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:17:13.07,0:17:15.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天随便什么时候都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.07,0:17:15.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sometime today would be nice
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.18,0:17:16.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.18,0:17:16.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm ready
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.52,0:17:18.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的海神王啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.52,0:17:18.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Dear Neptune
Dialogue: 1,0:17:23.52,0:17:24.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,少化了一处
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.52,0:17:24.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Missed a spot
Dialogue: 1,0:17:25.95,0:17:27.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你不称赞一下我的打扮吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.95,0:17:27.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to compliment my outfit?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:28.80,0:17:30.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你打扮得好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.80,0:17:30.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You look stunning?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:31.19,0:17:32.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你可真体贴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.19,0:17:32.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're so sweet
Dialogue: 1,0:17:32.81,0:17:33.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的花呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.81,0:17:33.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where are my flowers?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.69,0:17:34.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,花
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.69,0:17:34.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Flowers?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:35.06,0:17:36.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个  花在
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.06,0:17:36.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, they're, uh
Dialogue: 1,0:17:36.93,0:17:37.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你唇线笔掉了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.93,0:17:37.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did you drop your lip liner?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.57,0:17:42.58,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1084,344)}花店
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.95,0:17:45.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我好像没掉什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.95,0:17:45.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't think that I dropped anyth--
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.10,0:17:47.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  太客气了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.10,0:17:47.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, Squidward, you shouldn't have
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.64,0:17:49.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可这是应该的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.64,0:17:49.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I wanted to
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.67,0:17:51.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.67,0:17:51.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, you really shouldn't have
Dialogue: 1,0:17:51.77,0:17:53.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我严重过敏
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.77,0:17:53.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm very allergic--
Dialogue: 1,0:17:53.07,0:17:53.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,严重
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.07,0:17:53.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm very--
Dialogue: 1,0:17:57.10,0:17:58.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对郁金香严重过敏
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.10,0:17:58.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Very allergic to tulips
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.28,0:18:00.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,话说准备好出发没
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.28,0:18:00.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you ready to go?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:02.03,0:18:02.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,出发去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.03,0:18:02.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go where?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:03.27,0:18:04.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去吃晚餐啊  傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.27,0:18:04.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,To dinner, silly
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.87,0:18:05.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊  晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.87,0:18:05.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right, dinner
Dialogue: 1,0:18:05.65,0:18:06.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我去开车
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.65,0:18:06.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll get my car
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.48,0:18:09.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.48,0:18:09.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hop in
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.25,0:18:12.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,咋了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.25,0:18:12.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.75,0:18:15.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,绅士总会帮淑女开门
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.75,0:18:15.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A gentleman always opens a door for a lady
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.64,0:18:19.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我怎么会忘了礼貌
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.64,0:18:19.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where are my manners?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:27.55,0:18:29.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  那么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.55,0:18:29.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All righty, so
Dialogue: 1,0:18:37.76,0:18:38.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.76,0:18:38.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.56,0:18:39.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我可以帮你系吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.56,0:18:39.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Could I help you with that?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.89,0:18:41.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不用  我应该能系上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.89,0:18:41.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, no, I think I got it
Dialogue: 1,0:18:43.04,0:18:44.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,笨东西
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.04,0:18:44.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stupid thing
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.60,0:18:46.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就不能
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.60,0:18:46.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you--
Dialogue: 1,0:18:46.97,0:18:47.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.97,0:18:47.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,there
Dialogue: 1,0:18:48.80,0:18:49.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,贴身
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.80,0:18:49.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Snug
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.70,0:18:51.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还走不走了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.70,0:18:51.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can we go now?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:51.93,0:18:52.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.93,0:18:52.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.50,0:18:53.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.50,0:18:53.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Great
Dialogue: 1,0:18:53.63,0:18:55.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先去尿尿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.63,0:18:55.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right after I tinkle
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.63,0:18:55.70,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(788,920)}叮 咚
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.67,0:19:09.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还好去了一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.67,0:19:09.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good thing I went
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.67,0:19:11.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感觉我都没法一路憋到餐厅
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.67,0:19:11.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't think I would have made it to the restaurant
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.67,0:19:13.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有什么问题吗  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.67,0:19:13.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong, Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.00,0:19:13.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.00,0:19:13.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 1,0:19:14.10,0:19:15.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就只是饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.10,0:19:15.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just hungry, that's all
Dialogue: 1,0:19:15.46,0:19:16.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.46,0:19:16.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Great
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.26,0:19:18.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我知道有个好地方  可以去那里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.26,0:19:18.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I know a fabulous place we can go
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.04,0:19:19.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,往这边走
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.04,0:19:19.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just head this way
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.37,0:19:20.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.37,0:19:20.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wonderful
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.05,0:19:23.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在这个停车标志前右转
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.05,0:19:23.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, now at this stop sign, turn right
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.24,0:19:23.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.24,0:19:23.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.30,0:19:26.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在这个红绿灯路口右转
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.30,0:19:26.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now at this light, make a right
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.04,0:19:27.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.04,0:19:27.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gotcha
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.12,0:19:29.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在这条街右转
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.12,0:19:29.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And then at this street here make a right
Dialogue: 1,0:19:30.13,0:19:32.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后在这个十字路口右转
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.13,0:19:32.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And then at this intersection there make a right
Dialogue: 1,0:19:32.24,0:19:35.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后停在前面那座橙色建筑门口
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.24,0:19:33.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And then park right near
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.52,0:19:35.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that orange building just up ahead
Dialogue: 1,0:19:36.62,0:19:37.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们到了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.62,0:19:37.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're here
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.55,0:19:39.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,知道吗  你可真是个奇葩
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.55,0:19:39.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're a real piece of work, you know that?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:39.81,0:19:41.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  章鱼哥先生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.81,0:19:41.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you, Mr. Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.85,0:19:43.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你可真会把真诚的赞美融入到约会里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.85,0:19:43.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Way to work a genuine compliment into the date
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.40,0:19:47.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在是约会的闲聊环节
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.40,0:19:47.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now it is the chitchat part of the date
Dialogue: 1,0:19:47.92,0:19:49.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,用有趣的对话让她开心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.92,0:19:49.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Amuse her with interesting conversation
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.21,0:19:51.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,闲聊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.21,0:19:51.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Chitchat
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.52,0:19:55.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,现在的天气居然会这个样子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.52,0:19:55.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can you believe this weather we're having?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:55.17,0:19:57.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,进展不错  但最好要先从
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.17,0:19:57.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, good effort, but you might want to start
Dialogue: 1,0:19:57.84,0:19:59.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,更私人一点的话题聊起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.84,0:19:59.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with something more personal
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.20,0:20:02.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,举个例  女生会想聊自己过得怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.20,0:20:02.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A woman might like to talk about her day, for example
Dialogue: 1,0:20:02.14,0:20:04.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她可能会想聊到工作升职
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.14,0:20:04.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,She might want to bring up her promotion at work
Dialogue: 1,0:20:04.29,0:20:06.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,或者养的宠物蜗牛有什么滑稽怪事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.29,0:20:06.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,or the wacky antics of her pet snail
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.50,0:20:08.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,或者聊聊自己约会差点迟到
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.50,0:20:08.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,or talk about how I was nearly late for our date
Dialogue: 1,0:20:08.57,0:20:10.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为我没办法决定要穿什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.57,0:20:10.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,'cause I just couldn't decide what to wear
Dialogue: 1,0:20:10.31,0:20:11.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且手上也没多少钱
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.31,0:20:11.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and then I didn't nearly have enough cash
Dialogue: 1,0:20:11.77,0:20:13.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,付不起美甲店员的小费
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.77,0:20:13.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to tip the lady at the nail salon
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.17,0:20:18.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,晚餐来了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.17,0:20:18.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Dinner is served
Dialogue: 1,0:20:19.46,0:20:20.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我饿死了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.46,0:20:20.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm famished
Dialogue: 1,0:20:22.82,0:20:24.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,千万别吃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.82,0:20:24.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't try to eat it
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.26,0:20:25.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都是塑料做的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.26,0:20:25.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's plastic
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.03,0:20:29.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这可是练习餐桌礼仪的大好机会
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.03,0:20:27.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, this is the perfect opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.66,0:20:29.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to work on your table etiquette
Dialogue: 1,0:20:29.15,0:20:31.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  可以把烤海草递过来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.15,0:20:31.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, would you please pass the roasted kelp?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:32.48,0:20:34.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给你  女士
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.48,0:20:34.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here you go, ma'am
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.96,0:20:35.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.96,0:20:35.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:20:35.95,0:20:40.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  坐你对面的可爱小姐是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.95,0:20:38.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Squidward, who's the lovely lady
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.92,0:20:40.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,sitting across from you?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:40.75,0:20:44.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,她好像在对我抛媚眼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.75,0:20:44.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think she's giving me the cutesy eye
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.09,0:20:47.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想都别想  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.09,0:20:47.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, you don't, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:20:47.85,0:20:49.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不能这么随随便便就闯进来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.85,0:20:49.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You cannot just barge in here like this
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.85,0:20:53.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我跟海绵宝宝还在约会演习呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.85,0:20:53.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob and I are in the middle of a practice date
Dialogue: 1,0:20:53.06,0:20:54.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.06,0:20:54.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So
Dialogue: 1,0:20:55.18,0:20:57.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个常来这逛吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.18,0:20:57.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you hang out here often?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:57.24,0:20:58.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这可是我家  笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.24,0:20:58.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, this is my home, silly
Dialogue: 1,0:21:00.12,0:21:01.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请问一下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.12,0:21:01.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me
Dialogue: 1,0:21:01.61,0:21:04.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这玩意咋就能帮得上我真正的约会了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.61,0:21:04.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How is this supposed to help me on my real date?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.28,0:21:08.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,更何况真约会五分钟后就要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.28,0:21:08.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Which, by the way, begins in five minutes
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.66,0:21:11.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  等等
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.66,0:21:11.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, wait
Dialogue: 1,0:21:11.70,0:21:12.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还没演习到
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.70,0:21:12.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We haven't covered--
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.37,0:21:18.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,约会入门法则都还没演习完呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.37,0:21:18.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We haven't covered all the tenets of "dating 101" yet
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.02,0:21:20.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  等等
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.02,0:21:20.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, wait
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.50,0:21:23.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有好几条法则
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.50,0:21:23.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's a couple more tenets
Dialogue: 1,0:21:33.22,0:21:34.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我都说了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.22,0:21:34.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,As I was saying
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.32,0:21:35.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还要再演习几条
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.32,0:21:35.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd like to go over just a few more
Dialogue: 1,0:21:35.52,0:21:36.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有关初次约会的重要方面
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.52,0:21:36.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,crucial aspects of a first date
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.48,0:21:40.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,比如
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.48,0:21:40.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Such as--
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.43,0:21:41.56,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.43,0:21:41.56,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:21:41.57,0:21:46.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能不能给我闭嘴  别来烦我了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.57,0:21:46.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you please just shut it and leave me alone?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.78,0:21:47.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.78,0:21:47.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:21:47.20,0:21:49.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别拿这句话唬我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.20,0:21:49.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't "um, Squidward" me
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.05,0:21:49.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.05,0:21:49.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.90,0:21:54.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你这个讨厌鬼  浪费我时间的小东西
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.90,0:21:54.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you annoying, insignificant waste of my time
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.45,0:21:55.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.45,0:21:55.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward--
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.94,0:21:56.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别插嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.94,0:21:56.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't interrupt me
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.12,0:21:59.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也别打电话找我  别看我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.12,0:21:59.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And don't call me, look at me
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.55,0:22:01.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别写信给我  更别想我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.55,0:22:01.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,write me, or even think of me
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.63,0:22:03.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为你和我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.63,0:22:03.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,'cause, you and I
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.67,0:22:06.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们不是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.67,0:22:06.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We are not friends
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.37,0:22:09.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,以后也不可能是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.37,0:22:09.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and never will be
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.28,0:22:12.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以说以后不会再约会了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.28,0:22:12.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Does this mean there won't be a second date, hmm?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.88,0:22:17.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你刚刚都看到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.88,0:22:17.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You just saw that, didn't you?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.00,0:22:19.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只看了全程
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.00,0:22:19.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Only all of it
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.17,0:22:21.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你多半以为我是个刻薄的混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.17,0:22:21.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And you probably think I'm a mean-spirited brute
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.78,0:22:25.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,与你心目中的形象恰恰相反  对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.78,0:22:24.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,which ironically is the exact opposite
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.11,0:22:25.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of what you were expecting, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:25.66,0:22:27.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,未必
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.66,0:22:27.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not exactly
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.64,0:22:31.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我认为不迁就白痴的人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.64,0:22:31.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think a guy who doesn't suffer fools lightly
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.48,0:22:33.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,正是梦中情人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.48,0:22:33.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,is totally dreamy
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.87,0:22:35.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,去吃饭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.87,0:22:35.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's go eat
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.45,0:22:37.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  我是梦中情人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.45,0:22:37.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, I'm dreamy
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.65,0:22:40.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,祝你们两个玩得开心点
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.65,0:22:40.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Have fun, you two
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.97,0:22:43.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  你的任务完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.97,0:22:43.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SquarePants, your work here is done
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.20,0:22:44.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,未必
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.20,0:22:44.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not quite
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.80,0:22:48.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你答应过我一起看电影吃塑料爆米花
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.80,0:22:48.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was promised a movie and some plastic popcorn
